{
    "title": "Hoarding and Cleaning",
    "description": "Become a professional cleaner in Hoarding and Cleaning and clean up the world's trashiest places!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe1Game Features \ud83c\udfe1 \r\nVarious stages!\r\nHomes, beaches, parks... cleaning missions in various locations await you!\r\n\r\nCleaning Upgrades!\r\nCollect trash, earn money, and acquire powerful vacuum cleaners and cleaning tools! You will be able to clean even more extensively and efficiently!\r\n\r\nClient Smiles!\r\nUse your cleaning skills to put smiles on the faces of those in need! You will be rewarded with special rewards as your satisfaction level increases!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f The fun of the game \ud83c\udf1f\r\nIn \"Hoarding and Cleaning\", players act as professional cleaners and clean up for clients who are in trouble because of the garbage everywhere.\r\nThe more trash you collect, the more money you earn and the more powerful cleaning tools you get!\r\nAs the game progresses, more stages and cleaning items will be unlocked and players' cleaning skills will improve!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Game Points \ud83c\udfae.\r\nThis cleaning-themed game offers a realistic and satisfying cleaning sensation!\r\nCleaning missions in various locations will keep you occupied and allow you to grow as a cleaning professional!\r\nSimple and fun gameplay draws you into the world of cleanup!\r\n\r\nEU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.\r\nPlease respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Become a professional cleaner in Hoarding and Cleaning and clean up the world&#39;s trashiest places!<br><br>\ud83c\udfe1Game Features \ud83c\udfe1 <br>Various stages!<br>Homes, beaches, parks... cleaning missions in various locations await you!<br><br>Cleaning Upgrades!<br>Collect trash, earn money, and acquire powerful vacuum cleaners and cleaning tools! You will be able to clean even more extensively and efficiently!<br><br>Client Smiles!<br>Use your cleaning skills to put smiles on the faces of those in need! You will be rewarded with special rewards as your satisfaction level increases!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f The fun of the game \ud83c\udf1f<br>In &quot;Hoarding and Cleaning&quot;, players act as professional cleaners and clean up for clients who are in trouble because of the garbage everywhere.<br>The more trash you collect, the more money you earn and the more powerful cleaning tools you get!<br>As the game progresses, more stages and cleaning items will be unlocked and players&#39; cleaning skills will improve!<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Game Points \ud83c\udfae.<br>This cleaning-themed game offers a realistic and satisfying cleaning sensation!<br>Cleaning missions in various locations will keep you occupied and allow you to grow as a cleaning professional!<br>Simple and fun gameplay draws you into the world of cleanup!<br><br>EU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.<br>Please respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.",
